263
00:21:43.719 --> 00:21:44.553
Yes.

264
00:21:48.223 --> 00:21:50.392
You must be Song Choo Ah.

265
00:21:51.601 --> 00:21:52.436
do you know me

266
00:21:54.187 --> 00:21:58.317
Everyone has the same name
that follows them.

267
00:21:58.400 --> 00:22:01.111
A name that everyone around you knows.

268
00:22:01.194 --> 00:22:02.029
What?

269
00:22:02.988 --> 00:22:06.033
For Si Chun, that name is Song Chu Ah.

270
00:22:16.251 --> 00:22:17.169
I'll go now.

271
00:22:17.669 --> 00:22:19.588
won't you finish

272
00:22:19.671 --> 00:22:20.547
Another time.

273
00:22:27.054 --> 00:22:29.848
Why are you here again?
Will you continue to follow me?

274
00:22:30.599 --> 00:22:32.809
Let's go to the studio. I want to hear the songs.

275
00:22:34.102 --> 00:22:36.438
- I myself...
- The director wants to see you.

276
00:22:37.022 --> 00:22:39.149
So I'll listen first. Is this a problem?

277
00:22:42.486 --> 00:22:43.737
Not really, but…

278
00:22:44.237 --> 00:22:45.072
wait

279
00:22:47.449 --> 00:22:48.283
But what is it?

280
00:22:50.660 --> 00:22:53.413
<i>When the sun sets</i>

281
00:22:53.497 --> 00:22:54.456
<i>Yes</i>

282
00:22:55.791 --> 00:22:59.878
<i>Memories emerge in the heart</i>

283
00:23:01.046 --> 00:23:04.633
<i>Sometimes I wonder how you…</i>

284
00:23:04.716 --> 00:23:06.635
I haven't finished yet.

285
00:23:07.636 --> 00:23:09.346
Here I will add the piano.

286
00:23:10.555 --> 00:23:12.224
<i>A breath of wind...</i>

287
00:23:12.307 --> 00:23:13.433
And here - drums.

288
00:23:13.517 --> 00:23:16.645
I'll turn up the volume
and at the end I will leave only the vocals.

289
00:23:16.728 --> 00:23:20.649
<i>Everything reminds me of you</i>

290
00:23:21.983 --> 00:23:23.568
The rest is not ready yet.

291
00:23:33.328 --> 00:23:34.329
<i>Honsey.</i>

292
00:23:34.913 --> 00:23:36.373
You are a true genius.

293
00:23:36.456 --> 00:23:38.625
How did you come up with such a melody?

294
00:23:39.251 --> 00:23:42.337
You're incredible, Honsey. Very cool song.

295
00:23:51.179 --> 00:23:54.099
You can go if you have finished.
I have to work.

296
00:23:54.599 --> 00:23:58.687
Why didn't you invite a male vocalist?

297
00:23:58.770 --> 00:24:01.106
I thought it would be better with a female vocalist.

298
00:24:01.189 --> 00:24:04.276
it would be nice
if only a man sang this song.

299
00:24:06.361 --> 00:24:07.279
I will think.

300
00:24:07.362 --> 00:24:09.239
Sing it yourself.

301
00:24:09.322 --> 00:24:10.657
No, thank you.

302
00:24:10.740 --> 00:24:13.952
sing You don't matter
you sing the opening track.

303
00:24:14.035 --> 00:24:16.580
- What are you doing? don't touch me
- Get up.

304
00:24:16.663 --> 00:24:18.498
- What uncle?
- Let me listen.

305
00:24:19.958 --> 00:24:21.960
- Don't touch me.
- Move.

306
00:24:23.253 --> 00:24:25.589
Let's hear how it will sound.

307
00:24:25.672 --> 00:24:27.757
I'll turn on the music and you sing.

308
00:24:44.733 --> 00:24:46.318
Why can't I hear him?

309
00:24:51.740 --> 00:24:53.742
Something wrong. I don't hear a voice...

310
00:24:56.244 --> 00:24:57.996
You are like a little child!

311
00:25:00.624 --> 00:25:02.959
Enough. I will do everything myself later.

312
00:25:03.043 --> 00:25:05.962
Why later? Do it now.

313
00:25:11.468 --> 00:25:12.302
What is it?

314
00:25:12.886 --> 00:25:15.472
Did you slam the door?

315
00:25:15.555 --> 00:25:17.140
They closed themselves.

316
00:25:17.682 --> 00:25:19.476
Same thing again.

317
00:25:19.559 --> 00:25:20.936
What? Is the lock broken?

318
00:25:21.019 --> 00:25:23.480
But to him. I wanted to fix it today.

319
00:25:23.563 --> 00:25:25.482
Why didn't you fix it earlier?

320
00:25:25.565 --> 00:25:29.236
It had to be fixed immediately.
Who knows what might happen.

321
00:25:33.740 --> 00:25:35.909
Call a local locksmith.

322
00:25:35.992 --> 00:25:37.786
You called out. My phone is there.

323
00:25:37.869 --> 00:25:40.080
Helpless as always.

324
00:25:42.207 --> 00:25:43.291
My jacket!

325
00:25:44.960 --> 00:25:47.629
What should we do? Help!

326
00:25:48.296 --> 00:25:49.798
We are stuck here.

327
00:25:49.881 --> 00:25:53.134
Open the door! Is there anyone there?

328
00:25:59.266 --> 00:26:01.685
Shall we stay here?

329
00:26:02.435 --> 00:26:05.522
Gjom can come in later.
He comes almost every day.

330
00:26:05.605 --> 00:26:07.524
Really? About which one?

331
00:26:07.607 --> 00:26:08.942
I don't know.

332
00:26:09.693 --> 00:26:11.361
He doesn't follow a schedule.

333
00:26:12.654 --> 00:26:14.281
Gomme. You are our only hope.

334
00:26:19.828 --> 00:26:22.455
I'm starting to worry.

335
00:26:23.164 --> 00:26:24.666
say something

336
00:26:32.007 --> 00:26:33.341
Didn't like the song?

337
00:26:34.759 --> 00:26:35.760
What?

338
00:26:35.844 --> 00:26:38.138
You were silent. I was embarrassed.

339
00:26:38.221 --> 00:26:39.723
No, the song is not bad.

340
00:26:40.974 --> 00:26:42.475
Just vocals...

341
00:26:44.728 --> 00:26:46.563
Did that girl I met sing it?

342
00:26:47.314 --> 00:26:48.148
Yes.

343
00:26:49.024 --> 00:26:51.192
You must be very close.

344
00:26:51.276 --> 00:26:52.193
And what?

345
00:26:52.277 --> 00:26:56.114
You must be close if you share something like this.

346
00:26:56.197 --> 00:26:59.117
What are you talking about? Tell me to understand.

347
00:26:59.993 --> 00:27:01.995
you know what she did
when did you see me

348
00:27:02.996 --> 00:27:04.372
"Song Choo Ah"?

349
00:27:07.125 --> 00:27:08.126
That.

350
00:27:10.337 --> 00:27:12.339
Yoo Rim never does that.

351
00:27:12.422 --> 00:27:13.840
But she did.

352
00:27:16.801 --> 00:27:19.679
What do you tell people about me?

353
00:27:19.763 --> 00:27:22.557
why did she say
that my name follows you?

354
00:27:25.560 --> 00:27:26.561
answer

355
00:27:27.103 --> 00:27:30.148
You already know what that means.
One of two.

356
00:27:31.483 --> 00:27:33.818
Or I constantly slandered you

357
00:27:33.902 --> 00:27:36.071
or missed you all the time.

358
00:27:39.616 --> 00:27:40.742
Or both.

359
00:27:51.753 --> 00:27:55.507
It's unpleasant to be locked up
when you want to run away, like always?

360
00:27:56.007 --> 00:27:57.092
Yes, it's annoying.

361
00:27:57.175 --> 00:28:00.470
I hated it when you ran away
as soon as you say something like that.

362
00:28:00.553 --> 00:28:01.554
That's what you need.

363
00:28:19.072 --> 00:28:20.448
This is a story about us.

364
00:28:22.158 --> 00:28:24.244
Yes. And what?

365
00:28:24.327 --> 00:28:27.414
Why do you have a girlfriend?
first invited the guy?

366
00:28:27.914 --> 00:28:29.499
I invited you on a date.

367
00:28:38.383 --> 00:28:41.177
Will you go on a date with me?

368
00:28:42.303 --> 00:28:43.138
Good.

369
00:28:43.221 --> 00:28:47.225
Think before you answer.
It's serious for me.

370
00:28:48.268 --> 00:28:49.269
For me too.

371
00:28:49.352 --> 00:28:50.186
That is...

372
00:28:51.396 --> 00:28:52.564
So embarrassing.

373
00:28:53.148 --> 00:28:55.984
We are friends. We can't just get together.

374
00:28:57.610 --> 00:28:59.988
You asked me out.
Why can't we?

375
00:29:02.282 --> 00:29:03.742
If we meet...

376
00:29:03.825 --> 00:29:05.118
What then?

377
00:29:06.745 --> 00:29:08.997
I will never leave you.

378
00:29:10.874 --> 00:29:12.333
So think carefully.

379
00:29:18.923 --> 00:29:20.175
stop smiling

380
00:29:26.431 --> 00:29:27.640
Enough smiling.

381
00:29:37.150 --> 00:29:38.818
Don't talk nonsense.

382
00:29:38.902 --> 00:29:42.238
You invited me because I followed you.

383
00:29:42.322 --> 00:29:44.199
What kind of delusion?

384
00:29:44.783 --> 00:29:47.869
I liked you, I followed you
and then you invited me.

385
00:29:47.952 --> 00:29:49.329
I liked you.

386
00:29:49.412 --> 00:29:51.873
The whole school knew I liked you.

387
00:29:51.956 --> 00:29:54.793
You only loved music and ignored me.

388
00:29:54.876 --> 00:29:58.004
I played the guitar every day to impress you.

389
00:29:58.087 --> 00:29:59.923
I went to this school because of you.

390
00:30:00.006 --> 00:30:01.007
You know, I…

391
00:30:03.426 --> 00:30:05.053
What? A minute

392
00:30:06.971 --> 00:30:07.806
To school?

393
00:30:07.889 --> 00:30:10.892
She was far from my home
but I went for you

394
00:30:10.975 --> 00:30:12.602
do you see I liked you first.

395
00:30:16.898 --> 00:30:17.732
wait

396
00:30:19.567 --> 00:30:20.902
since you…

397
00:30:29.035 --> 00:30:31.538
Gomm! Go Goem!

398
00:30:37.752 --> 00:30:39.546
- Ah!
- Goem, open the door!

399
00:30:42.966 --> 00:30:43.800
Of course.

400
00:30:48.179 --> 00:30:52.183
I wonder how you ended up there.

401
00:30:52.267 --> 00:30:54.143
I would like to know.

402
00:30:54.227 --> 00:30:56.020
Don't let your imagination run wild.

403
00:30:56.855 --> 00:30:57.689
I will go

404
00:30:58.273 --> 00:31:01.985
Record a track with your voice.
I will arrange a meeting with the director.

405
00:31:02.569 --> 00:31:05.697
What? Will Kim Mubi come here? invite me

406
00:31:05.780 --> 00:31:06.948
Why?

407
00:31:07.031 --> 00:31:10.702
I want to listen to Honsi's new song.
I deserve it.

408
00:31:11.619 --> 00:31:14.956
Please. Just say the date.
I will behave well.

409
00:31:15.039 --> 00:31:17.458
This is a business meeting, not a game.

410
00:31:30.346 --> 00:31:31.931
What were you doing there?

411
00:31:32.765 --> 00:31:33.600
Shut up.

412
00:31:36.394 --> 00:31:37.729
Do you need to fix it?

413
00:31:38.605 --> 00:31:39.439
That is?

414
00:31:39.522 --> 00:31:42.400
I thought Mubi and I could there…

415
00:31:42.483 --> 00:31:43.318
Go already.

416
00:31:43.401 --> 00:31:45.695
I'll go even if you tell me to stay!

417
00:31:46.696 --> 00:31:48.197
I have important plans.

418
00:31:48.281 --> 00:31:50.033
I don't care, I won't ask.

419
00:31:50.116 --> 00:31:53.828
I have it by accident
to meet someone, so come.

420
00:32:19.938 --> 00:32:21.439
Congratulations, what will you choose?

421
00:32:31.908 --> 00:32:33.743
Is it too much?

422
00:32:38.539 --> 00:32:41.292
If I'm going crazy, I'll say it's for Chun.

423
00:33:14.117 --> 00:33:15.284
Gomme.

424
00:33:16.577 --> 00:33:17.412
Chune

425
00:33:18.121 --> 00:33:19.622
were you going home

426
00:33:21.457 --> 00:33:22.375
What?

427
00:33:26.713 --> 00:33:27.714
Let's go home.

428
00:33:37.682 --> 00:33:38.516
Thank you.

429
00:33:49.193 --> 00:33:50.945
Congratulations. how much for you

430
00:33:51.029 --> 00:33:52.864
- Seven, please.
- Seven.

431
00:33:57.118 --> 00:33:59.829
I will be very careful.

432
00:34:01.372 --> 00:34:05.334
I guess I was thinking.

433
00:34:05.835 --> 00:34:07.837
Нічого не сталося, усе добре.

434
00:34:10.006 --> 00:34:11.340
Gomme.

435
00:34:12.216 --> 00:34:16.387
Я знаю, що я під твоєю опікою,
але ти не надто суворий зі мною?

436
00:34:17.638 --> 00:34:19.098
Why aren't you surprised?

437
00:34:19.766 --> 00:34:20.600
What?

438
00:34:20.683 --> 00:34:22.852
Усі навколо тебе лякаються,

439
00:34:22.935 --> 00:34:25.772
and you are never surprised
and always calm.

440
00:34:33.404 --> 00:34:34.405
You are right.

441
00:34:34.489 --> 00:34:37.325
I guess I didn't know where I was.

442
00:34:41.704 --> 00:34:44.123
I'm hungry Let's have dinner.

443
00:34:45.666 --> 00:34:47.668
Do we still have pulkogi?

444
00:34:47.752 --> 00:34:50.088
Навіть коли ти прокинувся після аварії…

445
00:34:56.094 --> 00:34:56.928
Even then…

446
00:34:59.847 --> 00:35:01.349
you weren't surprised

447
00:35:03.518 --> 00:35:08.439
How could you be calm
після такого нещасного випадку?

448
00:35:15.363 --> 00:35:16.197
Really?

449
00:35:20.952 --> 00:35:21.786
Chune

450
00:35:26.082 --> 00:35:27.375
Why do I think that you…

451
00:37:01.427 --> 00:37:02.970
I'm at home.

452
00:37:03.054 --> 00:37:04.055
How was the day?

453
00:37:05.640 --> 00:37:06.641
Good.

454
00:37:17.777 --> 00:37:20.821
Він сказав, що треба зустрітися.
What kind of games?

455
00:37:30.081 --> 00:37:32.208
Do not dream before my eyes anymore.

456
00:37:32.291 --> 00:37:34.835
Your area I will leave here.

457
00:37:34.919 --> 00:37:38.130
Don't talk nonsense and stay away.

458
00:37:39.298 --> 00:37:40.675
I've had enough.

459
00:37:47.473 --> 00:37:49.600
I treated him badly.

460
00:37:50.184 --> 00:37:53.980
Not the torment of a handsome boy. If he
you like him, date him.

461
00:37:54.063 --> 00:37:56.482
<i>Otherwise he will get tired of waiting and leave you.</i>

462
00:37:58.276 --> 00:38:00.111
good And let

463
00:38:09.161 --> 00:38:10.037
What?

464
00:38:11.163 --> 00:38:12.581
What is it?

465
00:38:12.665 --> 00:38:16.002
It's nice to sleep
next to his brother after so many years.

466
00:38:16.544 --> 00:38:17.378
did you sleep here

467
00:38:17.461 --> 00:38:19.547
And what? you don't like

468
00:38:20.131 --> 00:38:23.384
i thought you liked
because you hugged me

469
00:38:23.467 --> 00:38:25.052
Did you think I was Mubi?

470
00:38:25.136 --> 00:38:26.804
Don't be so disgusting.

471
00:38:27.638 --> 00:38:28.639
"Disgusting"?

472
00:38:29.307 --> 00:38:32.310
To high school

473
00:38:32.393 --> 00:38:34.812
you slept next to me because you were afraid.

474
00:38:34.895 --> 00:38:36.647
What are you grinding?

475
00:38:37.148 --> 00:38:39.066
Why did you suddenly talk about it?

476
00:38:39.150 --> 00:38:41.152
Then you peed the bed.

477
00:38:41.235 --> 00:38:43.070
- What?
- You watched the movie...

478
00:38:43.154 --> 00:38:44.989
There was no such thing!

479
00:38:45.489 --> 00:38:46.741
Got scared and got wet...

480
00:38:46.824 --> 00:38:48.326
No!

481
00:38:51.203 --> 00:38:52.997
You can't beat your older brother.

482
00:38:56.834 --> 00:38:58.336
Think about what you did wrong.

483
00:38:59.420 --> 00:39:00.254
Gomme.

484
00:39:01.047 --> 00:39:02.882
I'm sorry

485
00:39:06.177 --> 00:39:07.511
You are hopeless.

486
00:39:07.595 --> 00:39:09.180
Get up. Let's go eat.

487
00:39:31.035 --> 00:39:32.119
Let's go eat.

488
00:39:32.203 --> 00:39:33.079
OK.

489
00:39:33.996 --> 00:39:35.247
Are you going somewhere?

490
00:39:35.331 --> 00:39:37.124
Yes, to work.

491
00:39:37.208 --> 00:39:38.376
Really?

492
00:39:43.339 --> 00:39:44.173
And what?

493
00:39:44.256 --> 00:39:45.508
Nothing.

494
00:39:46.050 --> 00:39:48.719
You dressed up for work. That's all.

495
00:39:58.521 --> 00:40:01.399
Chune, why is the gate open?

496
00:40:01.482 --> 00:40:04.860
There was a little fight last night
we forgot to close it.

497
00:40:05.569 --> 00:40:06.737
- Come in.
- Of course.

498
00:40:12.410 --> 00:40:15.663
What? Potatoes have arrived
and brought potatoes?

499
00:40:16.288 --> 00:40:17.623
You say I'm a "potato"

500
00:40:17.706 --> 00:40:21.502
therefore, I only buy potatoes at the market.

501
00:40:21.585 --> 00:40:23.212
why did you come

502
00:40:23.295 --> 00:40:25.798
You are cunning.
You only call when you need me.

503
00:40:25.881 --> 00:40:28.217
I'm bored. And Mubi said she was busy.

504
00:40:29.885 --> 00:40:32.930
Can you handle it yourself?
Don't need my help anymore?

505
00:40:33.013 --> 00:40:34.682
When did you help me?

506
00:40:36.100 --> 00:40:38.519
Goem, you will pay dearly for this.

507
00:40:39.019 --> 00:40:40.271
I know Mubi well…

508
00:40:40.354 --> 00:40:43.232
You only knew her until high school.

509
00:40:43.315 --> 00:40:45.776
Goof. You are of no use.

510
00:40:47.027 --> 00:40:48.946
Well, well!

511
00:40:49.905 --> 00:40:51.574
- She won't like you.
- Huh.

512
00:40:51.657 --> 00:40:53.868
- Let's see what you are like.
- Yes.

513
00:40:58.914 --> 00:41:00.749
<i>I'm sorry I didn't come yesterday.</i>

514
00:41:01.459 --> 00:41:02.793
<i>Something happened...</i>

515
00:41:10.885 --> 00:41:13.220
<i>Regarding yesterday's chance meeting...</i>

516
00:41:13.304 --> 00:41:15.097
Do you even eat the skin?

517
00:41:18.559 --> 00:41:21.061
I heard there are a lot of vitamins in the peel.

518
00:41:23.898 --> 00:41:25.566
<i>Are you busy now?</i>

519
00:41:29.403 --> 00:41:32.406
We have many guests today.

520
00:41:43.209 --> 00:41:44.293
Are you busy now?

521
00:41:45.044 --> 00:41:47.046
I have never been busy in my life.

522
00:41:47.129 --> 00:41:48.130
You can

523
00:41:49.548 --> 00:41:50.966
come with me

524
00:41:51.884 --> 00:41:54.053
I need to go to work

525
00:41:54.762 --> 00:41:57.181
I have to deliver something and Jung Hoo is busy.

526
00:41:57.765 --> 00:41:59.099
If you have time...

527
00:42:01.060 --> 00:42:05.064
I have no choice
except to help. I'll be there for a moment.

528
00:42:11.862 --> 00:42:13.614
You can eat my food.

529
00:42:13.697 --> 00:42:15.032
Gomm!

530
00:42:20.246 --> 00:42:22.831
Did she say I was busy? She…

531
00:42:25.334 --> 00:42:26.585
Drink. You are suffocating.

532
00:42:28.837 --> 00:42:30.506
I can give you a ride.

533
00:42:30.589 --> 00:42:33.759
- You don't know where.
- I don't care. sit down

534
00:42:39.598 --> 00:42:41.225
Do you have sunglasses?

535
00:42:41.809 --> 00:42:42.643
Yes.

536
00:42:43.143 --> 00:42:44.144
Good.

537
00:42:47.982 --> 00:42:48.816
What is it?

538
00:42:49.984 --> 00:42:50.818
OK.

539
00:42:58.158 --> 00:42:59.577
Let's go.

540
00:43:05.165 --> 00:43:06.667
I ate my fill.

541
00:43:08.210 --> 00:43:11.547
They are like adults
and they use me as an excuse.

542
00:43:11.630 --> 00:43:12.548
Some kind of fool.

543
00:43:12.631 --> 00:43:15.634
Even in small children
a more mature relationship than theirs.

544
00:43:16.594 --> 00:43:18.012
They are cute.

545
00:43:20.055 --> 00:43:21.932
Mubi disappointed me.

546
00:43:22.558 --> 00:43:24.893
Maybe she could behave like an adult.

547
00:43:29.106 --> 00:43:30.858
Chun, shall we watch a movie?

548
00:43:33.944 --> 00:43:35.362
Did Golem collect it all?

549
00:43:36.155 --> 00:43:40.034
Apparently, he sat at home all the time,
once rewatched so many movies.

550
00:43:42.119 --> 00:43:44.204
Is that why he still acts like a child?

551
00:43:46.832 --> 00:43:47.875
Maybe this one?

552
00:43:52.212 --> 00:43:53.631
- Chune.
- What?

553
00:43:56.008 --> 00:43:58.927
You've been kind of sleepy lately.
are you tired

554
00:43:59.970 --> 00:44:02.973
Yes, I'm a little tired.

555
00:44:04.767 --> 00:44:06.352
I'm going to take a nap.

556
00:44:40.427 --> 00:44:44.098
I'm sorry I didn't come yesterday.

557
00:44:45.349 --> 00:44:47.184
Yesterday? For what?

558
00:44:48.686 --> 00:44:51.772
We were supposed to meet by chance...
didn't you go

559
00:44:51.855 --> 00:44:54.775
Really? I didn't go.

560
00:44:56.694 --> 00:44:57.945
It made it easier.

561
00:45:26.140 --> 00:45:27.975
- It can't be.
- What?

562
00:45:29.768 --> 00:45:32.938
I am not alone today. What a shame.

563
00:45:33.021 --> 00:45:35.190
Hold on!

564
00:45:39.611 --> 00:45:42.865
Please no. Go, tin.

565
00:45:48.829 --> 00:45:51.790
- This is a very old car.
- Wait, then...

566
00:45:53.709 --> 00:45:57.254
Are we stuck here?

567
00:45:59.256 --> 00:46:00.257
Yes.

568
00:46:02.468 --> 00:46:03.719
This is bad.

569
00:46:18.358 --> 00:46:20.068
Had to take my car.

570
00:46:21.236 --> 00:46:22.571
Yes, okay.

571
00:46:24.490 --> 00:46:26.867
Don't say that in front of my car.

572
00:46:28.118 --> 00:46:31.955
I wanted to make it to sunset
but I think it won't work.

573
00:46:32.039 --> 00:46:34.166
We can go tomorrow.

574
00:46:34.249 --> 00:46:35.542
What?

575
00:46:35.626 --> 00:46:38.712
I'm busy You think I'm here
to be with you?

576
00:46:39.588 --> 00:46:41.048
Isn't it?

577
00:46:41.840 --> 00:46:44.843
You said you had to take something
and did not take anything.

578
00:46:45.427 --> 00:46:48.514
She said Jung Hoo was busy,
and he ate potatoes from me.

579
00:46:49.264 --> 00:46:52.434
Didn't you try to ask me out?

580
00:46:58.649 --> 00:47:02.945
You suggested it for the first time
do something together.

581
00:47:10.327 --> 00:47:13.747
Five years ago, when you disappeared…

582
00:47:15.082 --> 00:47:18.460
You know how to make me feel awkward.

583
00:47:19.253 --> 00:47:20.337
It was connected…

584
00:47:22.256 --> 00:47:23.757
with your brother?

585
00:47:25.551 --> 00:47:27.135
I thought about it

586
00:47:27.219 --> 00:47:29.638
since you moved
and I met your brother.

587
00:47:30.222 --> 00:47:32.808
You liked to talk about him.

588
00:47:33.517 --> 00:47:38.939
But your brother turned out to be different
than in your stories.

589
00:47:40.315 --> 00:47:41.984
So I guessed.

590
00:47:43.735 --> 00:47:46.572
Then why didn't you ask for so long?

591
00:47:52.327 --> 00:47:54.162
I don't like when it's difficult.

592
00:47:56.498 --> 00:47:58.917
I don't like getting close.

593
00:47:59.418 --> 00:48:02.588
It is better not to delve
in another person's life.

594
00:48:04.006 --> 00:48:05.299
I know myself.

595
00:48:05.841 --> 00:48:08.760
As soon as I learn something about someone,
i want to know more

596
00:48:08.844 --> 00:48:11.597
We will have to dive even deeper.

597
00:48:12.389 --> 00:48:15.225
And in the end, I'll be a fool
who doesn't even understand

598
00:48:15.309 --> 00:48:17.644
that this person is about to leave me.

599
00:48:21.106 --> 00:48:23.817
That's why I didn't want to know more about you.

600
00:48:23.901 --> 00:48:28.113
It seems that there is something extremely complex about you.

601
00:48:31.617 --> 00:48:32.868
And what has changed?

602
00:48:33.869 --> 00:48:37.915
what i hate most
when someone disappears without a word.

603
00:48:37.998 --> 00:48:43.128
Even so, I still like you.

604
00:48:46.632 --> 00:48:49.217
I can't find a reason to hate you.

605
00:48:56.058 --> 00:48:57.476
So I decided…

606
00:48:59.895 --> 00:49:01.480
complicate everything.

607
00:49:08.946 --> 00:49:10.697
If I understand correctly…

608
00:49:10.781 --> 00:49:11.949
I like you.

609
00:49:29.091 --> 00:49:31.093
<i>Without a doubt, this time my life...</i>

610
00:49:33.887 --> 00:49:35.430
<i>turned into a melodrama.</i>

611
00:49:36.723 --> 00:49:40.560
What kind of person am I?

612
00:49:41.979 --> 00:49:43.647
Whatever kind of person you are.

613
00:51:03.560 --> 00:51:08.231
<i>And I know for sure,</i>
<i>that this movie will have a happy ending.</i>

614
00:51:49.314 --> 00:51:51.733
<i>But life is longer than any movie.</i>

615
00:52:05.038 --> 00:52:06.373
Such

616
00:52:09.793 --> 00:52:11.628
Thank you for the food.

617
00:52:13.588 --> 00:52:16.007
<i>We all live our lives.</i>

618
00:52:29.187 --> 00:52:30.021
Gomme.

619
00:52:30.772 --> 00:52:31.773
What?

620
00:52:31.857 --> 00:52:33.567
<i>But I realized that some have...</i>

621
00:52:34.067 --> 00:52:35.068
I…

622
00:52:37.154 --> 00:52:38.905
I have something to tell you.

623
00:52:41.032 --> 00:52:44.452
<i>…life is much shorter.</i>

624
00:52:50.500 --> 00:52:56.173
LIKE IN THE MOVIE

625
00:55:24.612 --> 00:55:26.865
Translation of subtitles: Natalya Kovalyshyn

